# The files of a node bundle: what a node needs to install, run, update and remove itself, without
# the sources (scripts/make-bundle.sh packs them; scripts/get.sh and an update of a bundle install
# unpack only these). One path or shell glob per line, relative to the top of the repository.
# A bundle install runs the signed release images only; building needs a git checkout.
